  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementation of the ExM Zimbabwe 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The European Union will send an election exploratory mission to Zimbabwe to assess the usefulness, advisability and feasibility of a fully-fledged EU Election Observation Mission for the upcoming General Elections (July 2023). IOM will identify four experts (one electoral/political expert, one legal expert, one logistics expert and one security expert), who will travel to Harare for approximately 15 days, to collect factual information on the election process, make necessary preliminary logistics enquiries and provide advice on how to organize the operational component of a possible EU EOM and assess the security situation in the country. IOM will have no visibility and will not be associated to the work or the reports written by the experts; IOM will provide administrative, logistics and security support to the exploratory mission.</narrative>
  </description>
